- row  plain `true`  a boolean
- row  plain `42`  an integer
- row  plain `~` or `null`  a null
- row  `'…'`, single-quoted  text, taking no escapes; a quote is doubled to include one
- row  `"…"`, double-quoted  text, taking the full escape set
